{"review_id": "79b09d32-01e6-4cd8-8c94-73b33dd4a639", "package": "com.virblue.mystudylife", "app_name": "My Study Life - School Planner", "language": "zh-CN", "language_name": "Chinese (Simplified)", "rating": 5, "text": "Love it so much so far! It helps me manage my days by collectively showing what classes I am taking and what tasks need to be done at what time in a monthly timetable. Creating a schedule means convenience and fun with it. When I have done my assignments, I need to click on the task tab and set the process bar 100%. This prevents me from accidently \"finishing\" a tasks without knowing it. I want to say thank you to this app's developer(s) : - )", "author": "Stella Yang", "date": "2021-03-22T13:08:12Z", "thumbs_up": 1, "app_version": "6.2.7", "developer_reply": "Hello Stella . Thank you so much for the awesome review! We appreciate you making the effort for this. We are glad you love My Study Life and truly maximize its full potential! Please spread the love and tell all your friends about MyStudyLife!😊😊 #HappyStudying"}
